&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;August 2018&lt;/strong&gt; - Updated practice views to show capabilities grouped under top-level categories and moved
    legacy navigation views to a separate plug-in.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
