<attribute name="goals" nodeId="fefabbc8">&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;February&amp;nbsp;2023&lt;/strong&gt; - split navigator views between process and content, and reclassified&amp;nbsp;the
    following elements:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Tool Definition &lt;strong&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Product
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Tool Guide &lt;strong&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Product Guide
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Job Aid &lt;strong&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Tool
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Enhanced Workstreams to be WBS driven, and dropped Subject Areas in favor of typable custom categories.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Added concepts&amp;nbsp;to accommodate new skins
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Concept: Types of Guidance
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Concept: Types of Work Products
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Concept: Process Elements
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Concept: Organizational Elements
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;April 2022&lt;/strong&gt; - added new type for Alliances, and switched out icon for Pursuit Support
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;July 2021&lt;/strong&gt; - updated for latest version of Method Composer including separating out tool guides under
    technology and grouping publishing support elements to collapse generated menus
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;March 2021&lt;/strong&gt; - added text regarding default MS-Project values for project plan element
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;October 2020&lt;/strong&gt; - tweaked wording of brief description used to list training related guidance
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;February 2020&lt;/strong&gt; - updated navigation to include support for new Pursuit Support, Getting Started, and
    Training elements to replace existing Method Summary Pages.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;April 2019&lt;/strong&gt; - updated navigation views to include Metrics and BOTs guidance elements
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;June 2018&lt;/strong&gt; - Added support for collapsed left-hand navigator to show all content on a single accordion
    tab and built views to auto-configure. Synched practice categories with latest release of EYSM.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;February 2017&lt;/strong&gt; - Added guidance views to support breaking out of technical delivery related guidance
    from management guidance and made sequencing consistent with individual element layouts. Updated icons supporting
    materials and deliverables to align with updates to default resource files. Removed the approach element from the left
    hand navigator and included contained materials directly in the navigation view. Synched practice categories with
    latest release of EYSM.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
